# A label and the target of a 'goto' are in a namespace of their own, so
# this phase resolves neither and reports neither as a missing name. Whether
# the label a 'goto' names exists is the StatementChecker's question, per
# function, and 'never_written' is its one diagnostic here (2026-09-24)
def main : i32
    label again
    goto again
    goto never_written
    return 0
